OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for rape and child sex
OL,4,Aoffence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for raping a
OL,7,Fwoman and a child sex offence, police
OL,8,Fhave said.
OL,10,FTimothy Markham, 39, of Boston, was
OL,11,Ffound guilty of two counts of rape and
OL,12,Fa third offence of engaging in sexual
OL,13,Fcommunication with a child after a
OL,14,Ffour-day trial at Lincoln Crown Court
OL,15,Fwhich concluded on 20 August. He denied
OL,16,Fall three charges.
OL,18,FMarkham was sentenced to 14 years and
OL,19,Ftwo months in prison at Lincoln Crown
OL,20,FCourt on 22 October and has been added
OL,21,Fto the sex offenders register for life.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
